[SIZE="4"][B]Bug reports:[/B][/SIZE]
Please include:
[LIST]
[*]Clean or dirty flash, and whether GApps are installed
[*]Your carrier and the signal quality, for call or data issues
[*]What you did, and what happened
[*]A logcat ([I]adb logcat -v threadtime[/I]) and, for crashes, [I]adb shell su -c dmesg[/I]. Do not post huge logs unless asked.
[/LIST]
Do not report issues from other L50 variants.

